 "{upcomingCount} bills come out of this account soon, totalling {accountMoney}, which would leave {accountMoney2}.": "{upcomingCount} pagos salen pronto de esta cuenta, por un total de {accountMoney}, lo que dejaría {accountMoney2}.",
 "At these payments the interest is keeping up with what is being paid, so {names} would not clear. Raising the payment, or lowering the rate, is what changes that.": "Con estos pagos, el interés va al parejo de lo que se paga, así que {names} no se terminaría de pagar. Subir el pago o bajar la tasa es lo que cambia eso.",
